    "detailed_description": "You're a pilot on the Persephone, humanity's last colony ship sent into the inky black before a gamma ray burst sterilized Earth. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore a unique, procedurally generated galaxy filled with alien artifacts and resources to extract and exploit. Try to eke enough matter from the cosmos to keep the guttering candle of humanity alight for one last jaunt into the dark. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay with your friends with local co-op, or use Steam Remote Play together to mine asteroids, harvest nebulae, and harness the cosmos to support the Persephone and her precious cargo of cryogenic humanity as you search for a new home",
    "about_the_game": "You're a pilot on the Persephone, humanity's last colony ship sent into the inky black before a gamma ray burst sterilized Earth. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore a unique, procedurally generated galaxy filled with alien artifacts and resources to extract and exploit. Try to eke enough matter from the cosmos to keep the guttering candle of humanity alight for one last jaunt into the dark. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay with your friends with local co-op, or use Steam Remote Play together to mine asteroids, harvest nebulae, and harness the cosmos to support the Persephone and her precious cargo of cryogenic humanity as you search for a new home",
    "short_description": "Explore a unique, procedurally generated galaxy filled with alien artifacts and resources to extract and exploit. Mine asteroids, harvest nebula, pilot unique ships and find new and strange things in the void between stars as you struggle to survive long enough to find another home.",
